          {
            "source_call_id": "toolu_014uhDmRN3hyRwf2Z2eJaCXP",
            "content": "{\"id\":\"compatibility-matrix\",\"title\":\"Service compatibility matrix\",\"tags\":[\"compatibility\",\"release\"],\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-10\",\"body\":\"# Service compatibility matrix\\n\\nStatus: current. Maintained by the release team; last change 2026-10-10.\\n\\n## Requirements\\n\\nEach row: a consumer series needs at least this version of the provider in `prod`.\\n\\n| Consumer | Series | Provider | Minimum |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| billing-api | 8.0.x | ledger-api | 5.2.0 |\\n| billing-api | 8.1.x | ledger-api | 6.0.0 |\\n| cart-svc | 5.3.x | pricing-svc | 3.8.0 |\\n| cart-svc | 5.3.x | session-svc | 2.5.0 |\\n| cart-svc | 5.4.x | pricing-svc | 3.9.0 |\\n| cart-svc | 5.4.x | session-svc | 2.6.0 |\\n| checkout-web | 8.8.x | cart-svc | 5.3.0 |\\n| checkout-web | 8.8.x | edge-gateway | 3.0.0 |\\n| checkout-web | 9.0.x | cart-svc | 5.4.0 |\\n| checkout-web | 9.0.x | edge-gateway | 3.1.0 |\\n| email-worker | 1.9.x | notify-worker | 2.2.0 |\\n| orders-api | 3.2.x | billing-api | 8.0.0 |\\n| orders-api | 3.2.x | inventory-sync | 2.3.0 |\\n| orders-api | 3.3.x | billing-api | 8.1.0 |\\n| orders-api | 3.3.x | inventory-sync | 2.4.0 |\\n| pricing-svc | 3.10.x | catalog-svc | 7.1.0 |\\n| search-api | 1.13.x | catalog-svc | 7.0.0 |\\n| search-api | 1.14.x | catalog-svc | 7.2.0 |\\n| session-svc | 2.6.x | auth-api | 4.8.0 |\\n\\n## Yank notices\\n\\nA yanked version must not be deployed. The replacement is the version to ship instead.\\n\\n| Service | Yanked | Replacement | Yanked on | Reason |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| notify-worker | 2.3.3 | 2.4.0 | 2026-09-22 | duplicate deliveries after a broker failover |\\n| edge-gateway | 3.1.0 | 3.1.1 | 2026-10-06 | TLS session resumption leaks memory under load |\\n| catalog-svc | 7.2.0 | 7.2.1 | 2026-10-10 | the category index migration drops archived products |\\n\"}"
